            'body_en' => "1. Each student is entitled to one free trial session only per subject.\n2. The trial session introduces the student and guardian to the teacher's style and the quality of the platform's service.\n3. The trial session is not repeated, cannot be exchanged for money, and cannot be added to the session balance after subscribing.\n4. After the trial session, once the student chooses the teacher, subscribes to the package and actual sessions begin, the choice of teacher is final for that package and cannot be changed during its term.",
