            'body_en' => "1. The student commits to the session times approved at booking.\n2. Individual packages: session times may not be changed repeatedly. A change request must be submitted exclusively through the platform (the \"Request reschedule\" button on the session page); any request sent outside the platform is not considered.\n3. Group packages and training courses: their times are shared by all enrolled students, so they cannot be changed by an individual request.\n4. A change request must be submitted at least 12 hours before the session.\n5. Every change request is subject to the platform management's approval. The proposed time must not conflict with other sessions of the student or the teacher, and only one pending request per session is accepted.\n6. The platform reserves the right to change session times in emergencies or when the teacher cannot attend at the scheduled time, and will notify the student of the new time by email and on the dashboard.\n7. Keeping track of session times is the responsibility of the student or guardian. The platform sends reminders as an extra service and is not responsible if they are not read. Make sure the time zone in your account is set correctly, as times are displayed according to it.\n8. Unused sessions expire at the end of the subscription period, unless the platform management agrees otherwise.",
        ],
