            'body_en' => "1. A cancellation or reschedule request must be submitted through the platform at least 12 hours before the session. An \"absence report\" may be submitted without proposing a new time, provided a reason is given.\n2. Any cancellation submitted after that deadline counts as an absence, and the session is deducted from the subscription.\n3. Missing a session without prior notice counts as an absence, and the student may not claim a make-up session or a refund for it.\n4. Cancellation or reschedule requests are not accepted once the session has started.\n5. In emergencies or force majeure, the platform may review the case and decide on compensation or rescheduling.\n6. The platform reserves the right to reject repeated reschedule requests that disrupt the regularity of learning or the teacher's schedule.",
