            'body_en' => "1. Sessions are recorded automatically, including audio, video, screen sharing and in-room chat, for learning review, quality assurance and resolving complaints.\n2. The recording link is available only to the participating student, the teacher and the platform management. Recordings are kept for a limited period (currently 6 months) and then deleted.\n3. The platform records when the student joins a session in order to track attendance. Only the teacher and the management can see this, and a student's attendance data is never shared with other students.\n4. Students may not record sessions with external tools, or publish recordings, session content or participants' data outside the platform.",
        ],
        [
