            'body_en' => "1. Complaints about session quality, teacher absence, technical problems, payment or scheduling can be submitted through the platform, and the management commits to responding within 24 hours.\n2. A session can be reviewed after it ends and within 7 days of its date, and the review can be edited within 24 hours of submitting it.",
        ],
